cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pyALDIC in your research, please cite the software paper below."
title: "pyALDIC: Augmented Lagrangian Digital Image Correlation in Python"
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python implementation of augmented Lagrangian digital image
  correlation (AL-DIC) for full-field displacement and strain measurement,
  combining a graphical interface with a scriptable API, adaptive quadtree
  meshing, and mask-aware subset splitting near cracks and holes.
type: software
authors:
